# The build context is the repository root, and most of it is not wanted in an
# image that answers a tunnel. Excluding by listing what to drop rather than
# what to keep is the wrong way round in general -- but the Dockerfile COPYs by
# explicit path, so this file is only about making the context small and about
# making certain that a stray local artifact cannot be swept up.

.git/
.github/
.claude/
.omc/
.worktrees/

# ESP-IDF build products and the per-developer config that may hold a Wi-Fi
# password. Neither belongs in an image; sdkconfig especially.
build/
sdkconfig
sdkconfig.old
managed_components/
dependencies.lock

# The simulator's own build tree and screenshots. The image builds its own.
sim/build/
sim/shots/
shots/

# The React Native companion app: a different product with a different toolchain.
app/

# Assembled by tools/edition/publish.sh from a live edition.
tools/edition/public/

# Local server state and secrets.
server/.env
server/data/
server/tunnel/*.yml
!server/tunnel/*.yml.example

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
*.log
